didates are also on the ballot but are not viewed as competitive.\n\nEvery major rating outfit calls the race Solid or Safe Republican, and prediction markets put Republican odds around 92-94 percent. The state's strong Republican lean, reinforced by a Trump rally planned in Durant, dwarfs any midterm benefit Democrats might hope for. Munson is a credible nominee and the narrow GOP runoff hints at some Republican friction, but nothing in the available evidence points to a close general election. Mazzei is a heavy favorite to keep the governorship in Republican hands.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0232, "margin": -13.12}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0251, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0363, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0381, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.035, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0321, "margin": -13.0}]}